[node name="Label" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Info" unique_id=318622348]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(100, 0)
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 20.0
offset_top = 16.0
offset_right = 963.0
offset_bottom = 600.0
mouse_filter = 2
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0.82346123, 0.99999994, 0.8705237, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 18
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Controls:
Select / Place a card : Left Mouse Button
Rotate shape : R
Cancel selection : Esc / Right Mouse Button

At the start of each turn, cards are drawn from your deck. Cards are free to play. 

Placed and unused cards go into discard pile, which will be reshuffled back into deck when its empty. 

At the end of each turn, the acid will rise until it reaches the [color=orange]orange line[/color]. 

All incomplete layers will be consumed by acid at the end of the turn.

Blocks require a foundation to stand on and cannot be placed in acid. 
Opposing elements (E.g. [color=blue]Water[/color] and [color=red]Fire[/color]) cannot be placed next to each other. 

To beat the level, build a full layer at the goal height (indicated by [color=white]white line[/color]) or higher.

Each full layer above lava but below goal height counts towards extra rewards. 

Redraw button discards your entire hand and draws just as many cards.
You gain 1 use per level. Each redraw can also be used to reroll rewards at the end of a level."

